<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - General Semi, NextLevel started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - General Semi, NextLevel started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said on Tuesday it started coverage of General Semiconductor Inc with an intermediate and long-term accumulate rating and it initiated coverage NextLevel Systems Inc with an intermediate-term accumulate rating and a long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- General Semiconductor stock gained 1-8/16 to 16-7/16 while NextLevel gained 11/16 to 20.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
